WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.568
"Let's race!" Rex said.

2
00:00:10.569 --> 00:00:13.615
"I'm going to win!" Sara said.

3
00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:16.225
"No way!" Rex said.

4
00:00:16.226 --> 00:00:25.694
"I'm faster than you!"

5
00:00:25.695 --> 00:00:28.672
Sid ran past trees.

6
00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:32.282
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

7
00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:35.525
Whoosh! Tor zoomed through the air.

8
00:00:35.526 --> 00:00:38.734
"No fair!" Sid said.

9
00:00:38.735 --> 00:00:42.283
"Tor is flying!"

10
00:00:42.284 --> 00:00:45.794
"Ha-ha!" Tor said.

11
00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:48.503
She shot past a nest.

12
00:00:48.504 --> 00:00:51.482
A bird flapped her wings.

13
00:00:51.483 --> 00:00:54.409
"I'm sorry!" Tor said.

14
00:00:54.410 --> 00:01:02.280
Small dinos were eating.

15
00:01:02.281 --> 00:01:08.158
They jumped out of Rex's way.

16
00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:12.805
"Yikes!" one dino said.

17
00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:15.917
"Oh no!" Rex said.

18
00:01:15.918 --> 00:01:21.949
"I'm sorry for scaring you!"

19
00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:26.806
Sara stopped running.

20
00:01:26.807 --> 00:01:29.905
"Let's race somewhere else," Sara said.

21
00:01:29.906 --> 00:01:34.019
"We're scaring small dinos."

22
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:37.046
"Good idea," Rex said.

23
00:01:37.047 --> 00:01:42.969
"Roar!" A T. rex stomped.

24
00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:45.494
Trees shook.

25
00:01:45.495 --> 00:01:48.385
Small dinos ran.

26
00:01:48.386 --> 00:01:54.510
"Ha-ha!" The T. rex laughed.

27
00:01:54.511 --> 00:01:58.730
"Hmph!" Sara said.

28
00:01:58.731 --> 00:02:03.060
"That T. rex is a bully!"

